spiderstpo.config.climbing=Climbing
spiderstpo.config.pathfinding=Pathfinding
spiderstpo.config.enabled=Enable improved spiders
spiderstpo.config.excluded_classes=Excluded spider classes
spiderstpo.config.path_search_budget=Path search budget
spiderstpo.config.climbing.tooltip=Enable surface climbing and choose spider classes to exclude. Changes require reloading the world.
spiderstpo.config.pathfinding.tooltip=Tune the amount of work performed by each path search.
spiderstpo.config.enabled.tooltip=Enable improved climbing and AI for vanilla spiders and their subclasses. Default: true. Reload the world after changing.
spiderstpo.config.excluded_classes.tooltip=Fully qualified class names to leave unchanged, including subclasses. Default: none. Reload the world after changing.
spiderstpo.config.path_search_budget.tooltip=Maximum nodes examined per search. Default: 2048. Higher values find longer routes but use more server time.
spiderstpo.config.debug_logging=Debug logging
spiderstpo.config.debug_logging.tooltip=Log nearby spiders, targets, paths, and drop decisions to the Forge FML log once per second. Default: false.
spiderstpo.config.falling=Falling
spiderstpo.config.falling.tooltip=Set voluntary drop height and fall damage for improved spiders. Server settings govern gameplay.
spiderstpo.config.max_drop_height=Maximum drop height
spiderstpo.config.max_drop_height.tooltip=Maximum voluntary drop in blocks. Default: 8. Zero disables planned drops.
spiderstpo.config.fall_damage=Enable fall damage
spiderstpo.config.fall_damage.tooltip=Allow improved spiders to take damage from falls beyond their safe distance. Default: true.
spiderstpo.config.safe_fall_distance=Safe fall distance
spiderstpo.config.safe_fall_distance.tooltip=Blocks spiders can fall without damage. Default: -1, following Maximum drop height. Set 0 or higher to override it. Each extra block deals half a heart, rounded up, with normal potion and damage modifiers.
spiderstpo.config.movement=Movement
spiderstpo.config.movement.tooltip=Set per-spider movement speeds. Server settings govern gameplay.
spiderstpo.config.spider_speeds=Spider speeds
spiderstpo.config.spider_speeds.tooltip=Entity ID or Java class name:speed. Defaults: vanilla 0.8, LOTR 0.35. Higher values move faster; size differences and potion modifiers are preserved. Full/simple class names and inherited entries are supported. Most specific class wins; full class name overrides entity ID. Values: 0 to 1024. Changes apply immediately.
